1. create a 2nd set ("B") of test pictures (mix of portrait/landscape, at least 3 of each)
2. put them in the directory of the picture shown (or change the app setting to the test dir if needed)
3. enable the watcher option in the app.
4. check which pictures are displayed
5. add the set B of pictures.
6. check if set B pictures are part of the slideshow (have to wait a bit to check that)




